window.CET6_DATA("data/articles/day-042.json",{"day":42,"title":"A Neighborhood Workshop for Repair","targetWords":[{"word":"link","gloss":"连接","context":"A neighborhood repair workshop created a link between practical skills and environmental responsibility.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"reflect","gloss":"反映","context":"Its activities could reflect a wider advance toward using things longer, without making every broken kettle an excuse to attack its owner.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"advance","gloss":"进步","context":"Its activities could reflect a wider advance toward using things longer, without making every broken kettle an excuse to attack its owner.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"attack","gloss":"攻击","context":"Its activities could reflect a wider advance toward using things longer, without making every broken kettle an excuse to attack its owner.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"push","gloss":"推动","context":"Organizers wanted to push back against waste, but their first attempt depended on trust.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"attempt","gloss":"尝试","context":"Organizers wanted to push back against waste, but their first attempt depended on trust.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"trust","gloss":"信任","context":"Organizers wanted to push back against waste, but their first attempt depended on trust.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"cry","gloss":"哭泣","context":"A child might cry over a damaged toy that adults considered worthless.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"track","gloss":"追踪","context":"Volunteers would track each repair and mention risks honestly.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"mention","gloss":"提及","context":"Volunteers would track each repair and mention risks honestly.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"appeal","gloss":"呼吁","context":"Their appeal was simple: bring something you intend to use again.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"intend","gloss":"打算","context":"Their appeal was simple: bring something you intend to use again.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"grant","gloss":"拨款","context":"A small council grant helped spread the idea and establish regular sessions in an unused room beside the public library.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"spread","gloss":"传播","context":"A small council grant helped spread the idea and establish regular sessions in an unused room beside the public library.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"establish","gloss":"建立","context":"A small council grant helped spread the idea and establish regular sessions in an unused room beside the public library.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"wish","gloss":"希望","context":"People who wish to repair an object must often adapt their expectations.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"adapt","gloss":"适应","context":"People who wish to repair an object must often adapt their expectations.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"fix","gloss":"修理","context":"A volunteer could fix a loose connection but could not make an old machine represent the latest technology.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"represent","gloss":"代表","context":"A volunteer could fix a loose connection but could not make an old machine represent the latest technology.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"operate","gloss":"操作","context":"Visitors learned how to operate equipment safely and extend its useful life.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"extend","gloss":"延长","context":"Visitors learned how to operate equipment safely and extend its useful life.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"match","gloss":"匹配","context":"Spare parts had to match carefully; goodwill alone was not sufficient aid.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"aid","gloss":"帮助","context":"Spare parts had to match carefully; goodwill alone was not sufficient aid.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"taste","gloss":"喜好","context":"Personal taste also mattered when choosing a visible patch.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"strike","gloss":"打击","context":"The goal was not to strike a bargain for the cheapest possible job, but to hunt for a workable solution, remove immediate hazards, and avoid the temptation to assume that every object was beyond repair merely because a shop would rather sell a replacement.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"hunt","gloss":"寻找","context":"The goal was not to strike a bargain for the cheapest possible job, but to hunt for a workable solution, remove immediate hazards, and avoid the temptation to assume that every object was beyond repair merely because a shop would rather sell a replacement.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"remove","gloss":"清除","context":"The goal was not to strike a bargain for the cheapest possible job, but to hunt for a workable solution, remove immediate hazards, and avoid the temptation to assume that every object was beyond repair merely because a shop would rather sell a replacement.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"assume","gloss":"假定","context":"The goal was not to strike a bargain for the cheapest possible job, but to hunt for a workable solution, remove immediate hazards, and avoid the temptation to assume that every object was beyond repair merely because a shop would rather sell a replacement.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"collect","gloss":"收集","context":"The workshop began to collect discarded components and connect people with different abilities.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"connect","gloss":"连接","context":"The workshop began to collect discarded components and connect people with different abilities.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"emerge","gloss":"出现","context":"Useful partnerships could emerge when an electrician met a person skilled in sewing.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"enhance","gloss":"增强","context":"These exchanges would enhance the service, provided that organizers could handle demand and sort incoming objects responsibly.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"handle","gloss":"处理","context":"These exchanges would enhance the service, provided that organizers could handle demand and sort incoming objects responsibly.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"sort","gloss":"分类","context":"These exchanges would enhance the service, provided that organizers could handle demand and sort incoming objects responsibly.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"advocate","gloss":"倡导","context":"One teacher became an advocate for repair education and offered to organize school visits.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":{"en":"advocate reform","zh":"主张改革"}},{"word":"organize","gloss":"组织","context":"One teacher became an advocate for repair education and offered to organize school visits.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"outline","gloss":"概述","context":"Volunteers prepared an outline of basic safety, showed pupils how to scan a device for obvious damage, and taught them to count the components before taking it apart.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"scan","gloss":"扫描","context":"Volunteers prepared an outline of basic safety, showed pupils how to scan a device for obvious damage, and taught them to count the components before taking it apart.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"count","gloss":"数","context":"Volunteers prepared an outline of basic safety, showed pupils how to scan a device for obvious damage, and taught them to count the components before taking it apart.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"hit","gloss":"打击","context":"A sudden hit to a fragile case could cause more harm than the fault they were trying to understand.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"boost","gloss":"促进","context":"Teaching could boost confidence without encouraging reckless experiments.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"communicate","gloss":"交流","context":"Visitors needed to communicate what had gone wrong, whether a tear in fabric or a button that would no longer respond when they tried to press it.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"tear","gloss":"撕裂","context":"Visitors needed to communicate what had gone wrong, whether a tear in fabric or a button that would no longer respond when they tried to press it.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"press","gloss":"按","context":"Visitors needed to communicate what had gone wrong, whether a tear in fabric or a button that would no longer respond when they tried to press it.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"clothe","gloss":"提供衣物","context":"A clothing charity joined the sessions to help clothe families economically.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"cite","gloss":"引用","context":"It could cite examples of durable repairs, but would not commit to saving every garment.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"commit","gloss":"投入","context":"It could cite examples of durable repairs, but would not commit to saving every garment.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"complain","gloss":"抱怨","context":"People were free to complain if a seam failed; volunteers used those reports to illustrate the limits of different materials.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"illustrate","gloss":"说明","context":"People were free to complain if a seam failed; volunteers used those reports to illustrate the limits of different materials.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"touch","gloss":"触摸","context":"Nobody should touch exposed electrical wires, and a repair involving serious danger belonged in a professional workshop rather than a friendly demonstration.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"A neighborhood repair workshop created a link between practical skills and environmental responsibility. Its activities could reflect a wider advance toward using things longer, without making every broken kettle an excuse to attack its owner. Organizers wanted to push back against waste, but their first attempt depended on trust. A child might cry over a damaged toy that adults considered worthless. Volunteers would track each repair and mention risks honestly. Their appeal was simple: bring something you intend to use again. A small council grant helped spread the idea and establish regular sessions in an unused room beside the public library.","zh":"社区维修工坊把实用技能与环保责任联系起来。它的活动可以反映延长物品使用寿命的更广泛进步，而不是借每个坏水壶批评物主。组织者希望抵制浪费，但最初的尝试依赖信任。孩子可能为一个大人认为不值钱的坏玩具哭泣。志愿者会跟进每项维修，并如实说明风险。他们的呼吁很简单：带来一件你打算继续使用的东西。一小笔议会拨款帮助传播这一想法，并在公共图书馆旁一间闲置房里建立定期活动。"},{"en":"People who wish to repair an object must often adapt their expectations. A volunteer could fix a loose connection but could not make an old machine represent the latest technology. Visitors learned how to operate equipment safely and extend its useful life. Spare parts had to match carefully; goodwill alone was not sufficient aid. Personal taste also mattered when choosing a visible patch. The goal was not to strike a bargain for the cheapest possible job, but to hunt for a workable solution, remove immediate hazards, and avoid the temptation to assume that every object was beyond repair merely because a shop would rather sell a replacement.","zh":"想修复物品的人常常需要调整预期。志愿者可以修好松动的接头，却无法让旧机器体现最新技术。来访者学习安全操作设备，延长其使用寿命。零件必须精确匹配，光有善意并不足以提供有效帮助。选择显眼的补丁时，个人喜好也重要。目标不是争取最便宜的维修，而是寻找可行方案、排除眼前危险，并避免仅仅因为商店更愿意卖新品，就认定所有旧物都无法修复。"},{"en":"The workshop began to collect discarded components and connect people with different abilities. Useful partnerships could emerge when an electrician met a person skilled in sewing. These exchanges would enhance the service, provided that organizers could handle demand and sort incoming objects responsibly. One teacher became an advocate for repair education and offered to organize school visits. Volunteers prepared an outline of basic safety, showed pupils how to scan a device for obvious damage, and taught them to count the components before taking it apart. A sudden hit to a fragile case could cause more harm than the fault they were trying to understand.","zh":"工坊开始收集废弃部件，并把能力不同的人联系起来。电工遇到擅长缝纫的人时，可能产生有用的合作。只要组织者能够应对需求并负责任地分类收来的物品，这些交流就能增强服务。一位教师成为维修教育的倡导者，主动组织学校参观。志愿者准备了安全要点提纲，教学生快速检查设备的明显损坏，并让他们在拆卸前数清部件。脆弱外壳受到突然撞击，可能造成比原故障更严重的损伤。"},{"en":"Teaching could boost confidence without encouraging reckless experiments. Visitors needed to communicate what had gone wrong, whether a tear in fabric or a button that would no longer respond when they tried to press it. A clothing charity joined the sessions to help clothe families economically. It could cite examples of durable repairs, but would not commit to saving every garment. People were free to complain if a seam failed; volunteers used those reports to illustrate the limits of different materials. Nobody should touch exposed electrical wires, and a repair involving serious danger belonged in a professional workshop rather than a friendly demonstration.","zh":"教学能够增强信心，却不应鼓励鲁莽试验。来访者需要说清哪里出了问题，无论是布料撕裂，还是按下后不再响应的按钮。一家衣物慈善组织加入活动，帮助家庭经济地获得衣物。它可以引用耐用修补的例子，却不会承诺挽救每件衣服。接缝再次开裂时，人们可以投诉；志愿者用这些反馈说明不同材料的局限。任何人都不应触碰裸露电线；涉及严重危险的维修应交给专业工坊，而不是作为友好演示。"},{"en":"Over time, the greatest benefit was not the number of objects rescued. Residents learned to ask better questions before buying, to understand the labor behind a product, and to distinguish a manageable fault from a dangerous one. They also found that sharing skills made neighbors less anonymous. The workshop remained modest, with limited hours and a clear policy on what it could accept. Precisely because it acknowledged those limits, its advice carried weight. Repair became a practical relationship among people, materials, and time, rather than a promise that nothing should ever be replaced or that enthusiasm could overcome every technical difficulty.","zh":"随着时间推移，最大的收益并非挽救物品的数量。居民学会购买前提出更好的问题，理解产品背后的劳动，并区分可以处理的故障与危险情况。他们也发现，分享技能让邻居彼此不再陌生。工坊仍保持适度规模，开放时间有限，并明确规定可以接收什么。恰恰因为承认局限，它的建议才有分量。维修成为人与材料、时间之间的一种实际关系，而不是承诺任何东西永远不用更换，或认为热情能够克服所有技术困难。"}],"previous":41,"next":43});
